# =============================================================================
# Profiles and User Data
# =============================================================================
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose: the bare `profiles/` form also
# matched packages/nightshade_core/lib/src/providers/profiles/ and silently
# excluded three production source files from every commit.
/profiles/

